  <content>
  <section><para>Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.</para>
<section class="check-understanding"><exercise data-content-id="73e4ba8b-5ba4-41b1-8314-aae3db1bcec7"><problem><para>
      <para>Which of the following points is the vertex of the quadratic function \(f(x)=x^2+8x+22\)?</para>
      </para><para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\((8, 22)\)</para><para>\((0, 22)\)</para><para>\((-4, 6)\)</para><para>\((4, 6)\)</para></problem><solution><para>\((-4, 6)\)</para><para>
      <para>The correct answer is \((-4, 6)\). </para>
    </para></solution></exercise></section><!--Interaction End --></section>
</content>
